# About Vertex Solutions

Vertex Solutions was founded to help SMEs and startups build practical digital products without heavy budgets. We combine pragmatic engineering and simple design to deliver fast results.

## Mission

To help small teams ship polished, maintainable digital products on time — with a focus on tested prototypes and measurable outcomes.

## Services

- **Product Strategy & UX:** user research, wireframes, prototyping
- **Web Development:** R/Shiny, R Markdown websites, static sites, Node.js
- **Data & Analytics:** dashboards, data pipelines, light ML models
- **Deployment & DevOps:** GitHub Actions, containerization, automated builds

## Target market

Small-to-medium businesses, early-stage startups, and university research groups who need production-ready prototypes and documentation.

